      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but if it's \"highly controlled\" and \"sophisticated,\" that would explain why no one is talking about it or finding it. a regular person isn't exactly walking around with a mass spectrometer at the grocery store. if a major chain wanted to increase high-margin impulse buys by even 1% or 2% through something like this, wouldn't the profit margins justify the cost of the tech? it feels like it would be the perfect way to influence people without them ever knowing they're being manipulated.",
